1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 8.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></span></font></p><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">□ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">수강꾸러미 수강신청 확정 확인법</span></font><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">&nbsp;★&nbsp;\"원스톱서비스-학사관리-수강신청-수강신청 및 성적조회\" 탭에서 수강신청 내역 확인 ★</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">*</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">신청한 교과목의 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">제한인원보다 </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수강꾸러미 신청인원이 많거나, 학부(과)에서 확정제외&nbsp;처리시 </span></span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">수강신청과 연동 안됨</span></u></font></span></font></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">*</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">제한인원보다 수강꾸러미신청인원이 적으면 </span><u><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수강신청 확정 처리</span></u></font></span></font></span></font></strong></span></font></span></font></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 8.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수강꾸러미 수강신청 확정된 교과목은 </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">학년별 수강신청기간 본인이 직접 삭제 가능</span></strong></font></span></font></span></font></span></font></span></font></span></font></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong><br></strong></font></font></font></p><font face=\"굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong><br> <font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">★ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">수강신청에 관한 사항은 모두 본인의 책임으로 이루어짐을 알려드리며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span></font></strong></font></font></font><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">★ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">본인의 아이디 및 비밀번호에 대한 관리를 철저히 하여 본인의 의사와 상관없이 수강신청 또는 취소가 되는 사례를 예방하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">★ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">또한 악의적으로 타인의 아이디를 이용하여 수강신청 내용을 변경하는 것이 적발될 시 엄중히 처벌됨을 알려드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></font></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"26836\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 4673\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"user\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2020-02-07T14:49:15.804Z\",\n\"md\": \"2020-02-07T14:49:15.816Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false